{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"Sunan Abû Dâwûd","section":{"26":"Knowledge (Kitab Al-Ilm)"},"section_detail":{"26":{"hadithnumber_first":3641,"hadithnumber_last":3668,"arabicnumber_first":3641,"arabicnumber_last":3668,"name_native":"Livre de la science (Ilm)"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3659,"arabicnumber":3659,"text":"Rapporté par Abdullah ibn Abbas : Le Prophète ﷺ a dit : « Vous entendez de moi, d’autres entendront de vous, et des gens entendront de ceux qui auront entendu de vous. »","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}],"reference":{"book":26,"hadith":19}}]}